<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">afk</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">afk</ansi> command marks you as away from keyboard.
Other players see an AFK tag next to your name in the room.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">afk</ansi>                Toggle AFK on or off.
  <ansi fg="command">afk <message></ansi>      Set AFK with a custom message.

<ansi fg="yellow">Examples: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">afk</ansi>                You are now AFK.
  <ansi fg="command">afk getting coffee</ansi>  AFK: getting coffee
  <ansi fg="command">afk</ansi>                You are no longer AFK.

Typing any other command while AFK automatically clears the
AFK status.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help online</ansi>
